  "answer": "This is expected behavior rather than a bug. Command Palette doesn't actually hide or minimize its window when dismissed; it cloaks it so it can be summoned instantly. Screenshot tools that don't account for window cloaking (e.g. Snipaste) will still detect it as a window. The past ticket doesn't offer a setting to turn this off, so the practical workaround is to use a screenshot tool that ignores cloaked windows, or to select the capture region manually instead of relying on automatic window detection."
